Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:44:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/18] fix(board): first-buzzer banner hides reliably and
 never stacks with the strike X

The popup's 5s timer depended on the buzzed object, which is re-created on every
game update, so any host action kept it on screen over the board. It is now a
bottom banner keyed on the buzz identity (3s), dismissed when a strike is shown,
and doesn't replay on page restore.
